{
  "description": "Corrected seeded fleet recovery outputs after #47, #49, #50, #51. ReturnToOrigin restores cargo and retries; completed orders cannot be cancelled; cleanup precedes idle hooks. The historical fleet_collector_parity.json remains unchanged. Re-recorded when the travel executor replaced node reservation (AGV traffic part A, Task 8): an interrupt received during an arc now takes effect at the arc's end node (spec §8.3), so breakdowns and cancellations leave the AGV one node further on. Re-recorded for the fix of an order cancelled at the instant of its dispatch (AGV traffic part B, Task 3): a mission whose order was cancelled before the mission ran ends at once, without moving the AGV. Re-recorded when kinematic vehicles began to move in runs (AGV traffic part B, Task 3): nodes are passed at speed and an interrupt takes effect where the run comes to rest.",
